<b>To the me of a year from today</b>

10:39.890 --> 10:42.960
<b>Tanigawa Kisa</b>

10:39.890 --> 10:42.960
<b>From</b>

10:39.890 --> 10:42.960
<b>Date</b>

10:39.890 --> 10:42.960
<b>To</b>

10:39.890 --> 10:42.960
<b>Subject</b>

10:41.380 --> 10:42.950
<b><i>“To the me of a year from today...”</i></b>

10:43.950 --> 10:47.090
<b><i>“My parents’ faces are annoying.”</i></b>

10:47.090 --> 10:48.920
<b><i>“Riezo’s annoying.”</i></b>

10:49.650 --> 10:51.620
<b><i>“School this, school that.”</i></b>

10:51.620 --> 10:55.130
<b><i>“I wish she’d stop acting the good girl,
sending me text messages.”</i></b>

10:55.130 --> 10:58.030
<b><i>“I wish everyone would just leave me alone.”</i></b>

10:58.030 --> 11:00.900
<b><i>“It’s not like I’m ever going to be happy anyway.”</i></b>

11:00.900 --> 11:04.470
<b><i>“I don’t need friends who can’t understand me.”</i></b>

11:05.940 --> 11:07.670
<b><i>“I’d rather be alone.”</i></b>

11:07.670 --> 11:10.140
<b><i>“From, the me of a year ago.”</i></b>

11:13.450 --> 11:15.610
<b>My wish has been granted...</b>

11:16.450 --> 11:18.920
<b>This is all I wished for...</b>

11:19.950 --> 11:22.890
<b>Everything turned out just
the way I wished...</b>

11:28.560 --> 11:30.800
<b>But...</b>

11:30.800 --> 11:36.270
<b>...I’m not happy at all...</b>

12:08.600 --> 12:09.800
<b>Yes?</b>

12:09.800 --> 12:12.000
<b>Is that you, Aizawa?</b>

12:12.000 --> 12:12.700
<b>Who’s this?</b>

12:12.700 --> 12:13.710
<b>You idiot!</b>

12:13.710 --> 12:15.440
<b>It’s me! <i>Me</i>!</b>

12:16.380 --> 12:18.010
<b>Who’s “me”?</b>

12:18.010 --> 12:23.080
<b>Did you forget those summer days when we
chased after Old Lady Okaka together?!</b>

12:23.080 --> 12:24.750
<b>Sakakura?!</b>

12:24.750 --> 12:26.750
<b>That’s right. Geez.</b>

12:26.750 --> 12:28.690
<b>I heard about what happened
from Miyama.</b>

12:30.320 --> 12:31.560
<b>We’re not open yet.</b>

12:31.560 --> 12:32.820
<b>Hana-san.</b>

12:32.820 --> 12:35.160
<b>Oh, what happened?
You’re acting all formal again.</b>

12:35.160 --> 12:37.130
<b>I have a request...</b>

12:39.970 --> 12:41.930
<b>I think it was two or three days ago...</b>

12:41.930 --> 12:44.400
<b>Old Lady Okaka appeared in my dreams.</b>

12:46.240 --> 12:49.310
<b>Considering how cold this winter is, I guess I
should’ve known that even Old Lady Okaka...</b>

12:49.310 --> 12:52.510
<b>...couldn’t have had the physical strength
to bring herself back to Tana.</b>

12:53.310 --> 12:55.980
<b>You think she died?</b>

12:57.620 --> 12:59.380
<b>I don’t want to, but...</b>

12:59.380 --> 13:03.690
<b>...since she appeared in my dreams,
it has to be true, doesn’t it?</b>

13:03.690 --> 13:06.560
<b>Why do you think I called you?</b>

13:06.560 --> 13:07.490
<b>No idea...</b>

13:07.490 --> 13:08.730
<b>That’s not the right response.</b>

13:08.730 --> 13:12.060
<b>You respond by saying, “Why did you?”</b>

13:12.060 --> 13:13.400
<b>Then, why did you?</b>

13:13.400 --> 13:18.670
<b>Because Old Lady Okaka told me,
“I’ll leave the matter with Aizawa to you.”</b>

13:20.640 --> 13:22.140
<b>Did you hear me?</b>

13:25.880 --> 13:27.310
<b>Old Lady Okaka said that?</b>

13:27.310 --> 13:28.080
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:28.080 --> 13:31.480
<b>I wonder why she came to your place...</b>

13:31.480 --> 13:34.050
<b>Maybe she wanted to give
her final farewells?</b>

13:34.550 --> 13:37.260
<b>And because she was worried
about you...</b>

13:37.260 --> 13:38.920
<b>Er, Aizawa!</b>

13:39.990 --> 13:42.590
<b>The question shouldn’t be why
she came to my place...</b>

13:42.590 --> 13:45.460
<b>...but why she came to yours!
Think about it.</b>

13:47.700 --> 13:50.800
<b>I don’t know why, but she...</b>

13:50.800 --> 13:56.540
<b>Old Lady Okaka had some reason
for going to Yokohama.</b>

13:56.540 --> 13:59.710
<b>Don’t you understand that?</b>

13:59.710 --> 14:00.910
<b>Sort of...</b>

14:00.910 --> 14:03.720
<b>Don’t give me such flaky replies!</b>

14:03.720 --> 14:06.150
<b>Because you’re like this,
she can’t rest in her grave...</b>

14:06.150 --> 14:09.390
<b>...so she told me she’ll leave you to me!</b>

14:09.390 --> 14:12.260
<b>She’s in the afterlife.
Don’t make her come to me for that.</b>

14:13.490 --> 14:14.530
<b>Yeah...</b>

14:16.400 --> 14:19.100
<b>This isn’t the time
to be moping around!</b>

14:19.100 --> 14:21.270
<b>Get a grip!
Pull yourself together!</b>

14:22.470 --> 14:24.070
<b>You’re right.</b>

14:24.070 --> 14:26.800
<b>Are you all right?</b>

14:26.810 --> 14:30.590
<b>I just remembered something
Heigorou-san told me in Tana.</b>

14:31.440 --> 14:37.050
<b>“All that has happened and all that
will happen has meaning.”</b>

14:37.520 --> 14:39.680
<b>I don’t get what you’re saying at all.</b>

14:40.250 --> 14:43.650
<b>“This is a necessary process
people must go through.”</b>

14:44.160 --> 14:46.990
<b>Sakakura, thanks for calling.</b>

14:46.990 --> 14:48.790
<b>Have you finally gotten over it, then?</b>

14:48.790 --> 14:49.530
<b>Probably.</b>

14:49.530 --> 14:51.400
<b>Aizawa...</b>

14:52.400 --> 14:54.630
<b>Old Lady Okaka sure is amazing, huh?</b>

14:55.270 --> 14:57.600
<b>You better believe it!</b>

15:00.810 --> 15:03.440
<b>Thanks a lot, Hana-san.</b>

15:03.440 --> 15:05.840
<b>Is Shigeki at his place?</b>

15:05.840 --> 15:09.510
<b>Probably, but I’m making no progress
by text messaging him, so...</b>

15:09.510 --> 15:12.780
<b>But you don’t know what to say to him.</b>

15:12.780 --> 15:14.490
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:14.490 --> 15:16.150
<b>You know, until just a short time ago...</b>

15:16.150 --> 15:19.690
<b>...there were no such things as
“cell phones” or “text messages.”</b>

15:19.690 --> 15:22.830
<b>Yet no one ever thought of
that as being inconvenient.</b>

15:22.830 --> 15:27.730
<b>If you had to talk to someone face to face,
you put some thought into it while waiting.</b>

15:27.730 --> 15:30.840
<b>So what you wanted to convey
was actually conveyed.</b>

15:30.840 --> 15:33.840
<b>I wonder if our words have become
weaker nowadays?</b>

15:33.840 --> 15:36.810
<b>It’s not that cell phones or text messages are bad.</b>

15:38.210 --> 15:42.950
<b>It’s just bad when people read a message
and think that’s all there is to something.</b>

15:42.950 --> 15:47.820
<b>And when the person sending the message thinks
they’ve conveyed everything, since they sent it.</b>

15:49.320 --> 15:51.260
<b>Using excuses like it’s too inconvenient...</b>

15:51.260 --> 15:55.560
<b>...or because they just don’t want to meet,
people finish everything with text messages.</b>

15:55.560 --> 15:59.400
<b>Yeah! When it’s really important, you actually
have to meet the person face to face, right?</b>

16:00.870 --> 16:02.930
<b>I’m going to go see Shigeki now!</b>

16:21.450 --> 16:23.890
<b>I brought Tokimiya’s
deluxe omelette rice.</b>

16:23.890 --> 16:25.060
<b>It’s freshly made.</b>

16:26.630 --> 16:28.690
<b>I’ll come up now, okay?</b>

16:35.330 --> 16:36.530
<b>Is it good?</b>

16:38.200 --> 16:42.140
<b>There’s no way Tokimiya’s omelette
rice wouldn’t be delicious.</b>

16:42.140 --> 16:46.510
<b>Hana-san was worried about you, since you’re
still in the middle of your 3-dan league.</b>

16:47.180 --> 16:50.250
<b>So she made this for me because of that?</b>

16:50.250 --> 16:50.980
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:52.880 --> 16:54.690
<b>Coming here out of the blue...</b>

16:54.690 --> 16:57.150
<b>What were you going to do
if I wasn’t here?</b>

16:59.560 --> 17:01.630
<b>I’d have crossed that bridge
when I came to it.</b>

17:01.630 --> 17:05.360
<b>I didn’t know if you’d pick up
the phone if I called...</b>

17:05.360 --> 17:10.030
<b>But when I was young, I used to throw a pebble
at your window while calling your name.</b>

17:12.240 --> 17:14.370
<b>Shigeki, umm...</b>

17:15.240 --> 17:19.140
<b>What was Bun-chan to Kisa?</b>

17:21.180 --> 17:22.650
<b>Why are you asking me?</b>

17:22.650 --> 17:26.480
<b>Because you’re the one who’s been closest
to her and knows her the best.</b>

17:27.490 --> 17:31.460
<b>Kisa... thought that Bun-chan was born.</b>

17:31.460 --> 17:32.720
<b>Born?</b>

17:33.430 --> 17:36.430
<b>That’s why, to her,
it wasn’t simply destroyed.</b>

17:36.430 --> 17:38.100
<b>It was murdered.</b>

17:38.100 --> 17:41.770
<b>Something she could finally tell
all the secrets of her heart to...</b>

17:41.770 --> 17:44.070
<b>That’s what it was to Kisa.</b>

17:44.070 --> 17:47.200
<b>So that’s how it appears in Kisa’s heart...</b>

17:48.470 --> 17:50.070
<b>I think I understand...</b>

17:50.080 --> 17:53.950
<b>The problem she’s having right now isn’t
that what happened was right or wrong.</b>

17:53.950 --> 17:55.110
<b>Riezo?</b>

17:55.110 --> 17:58.150
<b>That’s why I want you to think about it.</b>

17:58.150 --> 18:00.250
<b>What you can do for Kisa right now.</b>

18:00.250 --> 18:03.420
<b>What only you can do.
I’m sure there’s something.</b>

18:03.420 --> 18:05.520
<b>It doesn’t have to be right this second.</b>

18:05.520 --> 18:08.990
<b>You can think about it for a while, but...</b>

18:08.990 --> 18:10.430
<b>...you have a time limit.</b>

18:11.000 --> 18:13.760
<b>In shogi, you lose if you run
out of time, right?</b>

18:16.770 --> 18:19.670
<b>And... thanks for eating
the omelette rice.</b>

18:20.840 --> 18:24.880
<b>I was the one who made it, after all.</b>

18:30.020 --> 18:31.950
<b>No way...</b>

18:37.160 --> 18:39.130
<b>Rieko-chan</b>

18:37.160 --> 18:39.130
<b>Makki, want to meet now?</b>

18:42.590 --> 18:44.100
<b>Rieko-chan!</b>

18:47.370 --> 18:50.100
<b>Makki. Sorry for calling you out
like this so suddenly.</b>

18:50.100 --> 18:53.270
<b>Not at all. I was nearby,
so it wasn’t a problem.</b>

18:57.040 --> 18:59.040
<b>Let’s get everything out in the open.</b>

18:59.040 --> 18:59.740
<b>What is it?</b>

19:00.210 --> 19:04.850
<b>Do you want to stay friends,
or do you want to be more than that?</b>

19:04.850 --> 19:08.490
<b>What do you want to do
with me, Makki?</b>

19:10.260 --> 19:12.820
<b>You don’t have to answer right away.</b>

19:12.820 --> 19:13.820
<b>No...</b>

19:15.630 --> 19:18.760
<b>I’m dear with my feelings,
so I can answer now.</b>

19:20.630 --> 19:22.200
<b>I...</b>

19:22.200 --> 19:24.740
<b>...like you, Rieko-chan.</b>

19:24.740 --> 19:25.670
<b>That’s why...</b>

19:25.670 --> 19:26.770
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

19:31.780 --> 19:33.010
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

19:36.920 --> 19:38.650
<b>I see.</b>

19:38.650 --> 19:43.490
<b>It’s not you, it’s me, Makki.</b>

19:43.490 --> 19:47.120
<b>So this is how it feels to be rejected...</b>

19:48.030 --> 19:49.590
<b>This is the first time I’ve felt like this.</b>

19:51.530 --> 19:52.300
<b>Umm...</b>

19:52.300 --> 19:54.270
<b>Makki.</b>

19:54.270 --> 19:56.300
<b>Umm...</b>

19:56.300 --> 19:59.670
<b>Even now that I’ve been rejected,
it’s difficult to stay friends...</b>

20:02.170 --> 20:06.380
<b>And I want to disappear right now, but...</b>

20:06.380 --> 20:08.450
<b>...I can’t do that.</b>

20:12.420 --> 20:16.290
<b>I still think there’s something I can do.</b>

20:16.290 --> 20:20.830
<b>Because Tanigawa, Kobayakawa....
we’re all friends.</b>

20:21.730 --> 20:23.360
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:23.360 --> 20:24.960
<b>Yep.</b>

20:24.960 --> 20:27.670
<b>I lost sight of what was so obvious.</b>

20:29.940 --> 20:32.770
<b>It wasn’t just you.</b>

20:32.770 --> 20:37.110
<b>You’re looking pretty good the
way you are right now, Makki.</b>

21:32.500 --> 21:33.760
<b>What the...?</b>

21:48.350 --> 21:50.610
<b>W-Why...?</b>

21:56.990 --> 21:58.760
<b>You’re not Bun-chan...</b>

22:09.940 --> 22:11.740
<b>This is...</b>

22:30.490 --> 22:32.220
<b>This is...</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.970 --> 24:22.940
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:20.470 --> 24:22.600
<b>Bum da da dum! Bam!</b>

24:22.600 --> 24:25.300
<b>The Blazing Flame of Justice, Roku Red!</b>

24:25.300 --> 24:26.040
<b>Da dum!</b>

24:26.040 --> 24:28.770
<b>With her infinite power, she quells
all her enemies, Okaka Yellow!</b>

24:28.770 --> 24:30.370
<b>Ba da dum!</b>

24:30.380 --> 24:31.510
<b>I’m not gonna do this.</b>

24:31.510 --> 24:32.540
<b>Huh? What’s the matter?</b>

24:32.540 --> 24:34.010
<b>Did you forget your line?</b>

24:34.010 --> 24:37.010
<b>It’s, “Still inexperienced and immature, Taruto Blue!”</b>

24:37.020 --> 24:39.020
<b>Yep! It’s, “Still inexperienced
and immature, Taruto Blue!”</b>

24:39.020 --> 24:41.150
<b>No way, no way!
I don’t want a name like that!</b>

24:41.150 --> 24:42.650
<b>I wanna be red!</b>

24:42.650 --> 24:44.620
<b>But red is the color of the hero, you see.</b>

24:44.620 --> 24:47.090
<b>I want red!
I want the heroic red!</b>

24:47.090 --> 24:50.800
<b>Geez! Roku Red, can’t you do anything
to resolve this problem?</b>

24:50.800 --> 24:53.900
<b>I know. On that note,
look forward to next time.</b>

24:53.900 --> 24:55.000
<b>Blast off!</b>

24:55.000 --> 24:57.840
<b>I should’ve known better than
 to ask the Flame of Justice.</b>

24:55.000 --> 24:59.950
<b>The Dark Lights that Bring Fortune</b>
